{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"本原单位根"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"本原单位根"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对正整数 $n$, 含幺交换环 $R$ 中的<strong>本原单位根</strong>是满足如下条件的元素 $\\zeta \\in R$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\zeta^n = 1$;</li>\n<li>对任意正整数 $k &lt; n$, $\\zeta^k \\neq 1$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}}